$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=recipsum  LOC_AFTER=?

* Mertens-type bound for the reciprocal sum of primes in ( w , z ]: there is a constant c such that for all 2 <= w <= z, sum_{w<p<=z} 1/p <= ( log z - log w + c ) / log w. Parallel to primeRecipSum_sub_le in RecipSum.lean, with an existential constant in place of 2 ( log 4 + 4 ).

